\f0\ltrch\lang1033 Now that we've built the authentication part, let's continue with the functionality for showing gifts and handling purchases, including gift lists, adding items to the cart, and displaying winners after the lottery\f1\rtlch\lang1037 .\par
\par
#### \f0\ltrch\lang1033 a) **Models for Angular\f1\rtlch\lang1037 **\par
\par
\f0\ltrch\lang1033 We define the TypeScript interfaces for the models to match the backend\f1\rtlch\lang1037 :\par
\par
```\f0\ltrch\lang1033 typescript\f1\rtlch\lang1037\par
\f0\ltrch\lang1033 export interface User\f1\rtlch\lang1037  \{\par
  \f0\ltrch\lang1033 userId: number\f1\rtlch\lang1037 ;\par
  \f0\ltrch\lang1033 username: string\f1\rtlch\lang1037 ;\par
  \f0\ltrch\lang1033 role: string\f1\rtlch\lang1037 ;\par
  \f0\ltrch\lang1033 email: string\f1\rtlch\lang1037 ;\par
  \f0\ltrch\lang1033 phone: string\f1\rtlch\lang1037 ;\par
\}\par
\par
\f0\ltrch\lang1033 export interface Donor\f1\rtlch\lang1037  \{\par
  \f0\ltrch\lang1033 donorId: number\f1\rtlch\lang1037 ;\par
  \f0\ltrch\lang1033 name: string\f1\rtlch\lang1037 ;\par
  \f0\ltrch\lang1033 email: string\f1\rtlch\lang1037 ;\par
  \f0\ltrch\lang1033 phone: string\f1\rtlch\lang1037 ;\par
\}\par
\par
\f0\ltrch\lang1033 export interface Gift\f1\rtlch\lang1037  \{\par
  \f0\ltrch\lang1033 giftId: number\f1\rtlch\lang1037 ;\par
  \f0\ltrch\lang1033 name: string\f1\rtlch\lang1037 ;\par
  \f0\ltrch\lang1033 category: string\f1\rtlch\lang1037 ;\par
  \f0\ltrch\lang1033 price: number\f1\rtlch\lang1037 ;\par
  \f0\ltrch\lang1033 donorId: number\f1\rtlch\lang1037 ;\par
  \f0\ltrch\lang1033 purchases: Purchase\f1\rtlch\lang1037 [];\par
\}\par
\par
\f0\ltrch\lang1033 export interface Purchase\f1\rtlch\lang1037  \{\par
  \f0\ltrch\lang1033 purchaseId: number\f1\rtlch\lang1037 ;\par
  \f0\ltrch\lang1033 giftId: number\f1\rtlch\lang1037 ;\par
  \f0\ltrch\lang1033 customerId: number\f1\rtlch\lang1037 ;\par
  \f0\ltrch\lang1033 date: string\f1\rtlch\lang1037 ;\par
\}\par
\par
\f0\ltrch\lang1033 export interface Lottery\f1\rtlch\lang1037  \{\par
  \f0\ltrch\lang1033 lotteryId: number\f1\rtlch\lang1037 ;\par
  \f0\ltrch\lang1033 giftId: number\f1\rtlch\lang1037 ;\par
  \f0\ltrch\lang1033 winner: string\f1\rtlch\lang1037 ;\par
